# S33-S34-exact: e1m6's corridor turning, the perspective found exactly at every pixel. A
# linear turn from yaw 101.3 down at 1.3 degrees a second, slop at 1920x1080, no status
# bar ("A tenth more work").
#
# Assembly (S34, the master's frames 384 to 1043): a 2x2 grid of 470x260 crops at
# (420,120), enlarged 2x (nearest): 64 and id's 16 above, 8 (slop, outlined in rust) and
# exact below, each labelled; from film second 11.7, each pixel that differs from the
# exact render's is tinted lava orange, and from 12.6 a caption sits under 8.

map e1m6

duration 17.4
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud off
cvar r_perspspan 1

camera path
key 0     504,500,242  0,101.2987  ease linear
key 17.4  504,500,242  0,78.7013
